    <statement><p>If <m>\mathbf{r} (t) = -8 t \mathbf{i} + 8 t^2  \mathbf{j} + 4 t \mathbf{k}</m>,
compute the tangential and normal components of the acceleration vector.</p>
<p>Tangential component  <m>\; a_T (t) =</m> <fillin characters="25" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>Normal component <m>\; a_N (t) =</m> <fillin characters="25" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{256t}{\sqrt{64+4\mathopen{}\left(8t\right)^{2}+16}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
